# Excluded from the Vercel deployment.
#
# Be careful what goes in here. Two paths were listed and had to be removed, because
# "not served to the browser" is not the same as "not needed":
#
#   theories/  is read at BUILD time. scripts/build-corpus.mjs compiles the markdown
#              corpus into the bundle, so excluding it fails the build with ENOENT —
#              and a failed build leaves Vercel serving the previous deployment, which
#              looks exactly like a deploy that silently did nothing.
#   demo/      is imported at RUNTIME by server/routes/analyze.js, which the API
#              function loads. Excluding it breaks /api/analyze in production only.
#
# Only list things nothing builds from and nothing imports.

tests/
docs/
*.png
.env
.env.*
